  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into wedges.\n• Place wedges on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and sprinkle with 1/2 the dried oregano (see ingredients). Toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the wedges between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bfb774b5019b855f09fad9/step-6ff0b886.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bfb774b5019b855f09fad9/step-56814d5a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bfb774b5019b855f09fad9/step-f1523638.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine carrot, tomato, salad leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bfb774b5019b855f09fad9/step-8367bbf3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add the honey and remaining dried oregano. Turn haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bfb774b5019b855f09fad9/step-01671621.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Greek-style haloumi, oregano wedges and salad between plates.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds. Serve with a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bfb774b5019b855f09fad9/step-acddead2.jpg"
    }
  ]
